Label15.Caption = Threadcount  \nin Calculations
Label17.Caption = its for free!
CalcOnLabel.Caption = Calculate on
CalcOnCombo.Hint = Auto: the CPU and the graphics card share the image (the CPU\nstarts at once, the card joins as soon as its shader is\ncompiled), the card then runs the shadows and the ambient\nocclusion.\nCPU: never the graphics card.\nGraphics card: wait for the shader, as before.
